    "collapsible_content_VM3JBN": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_9BEXQw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I have to send back my containers?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>We encourage you to reuse or recycle within your own community. If that isn't possible, or you would like to participate in our Close The Loop program, it is entirely optional! </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LENXD7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will you send me a shipping label?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>We do not provide a shipping label. Our Close the Loop program is completely optional. </p><p>To receive the best pricing, we recommend using a service like PirateShip.com to purchase your shipping labels.</p><p>Even if you choose not to return your containers, you can still  participate in the program by choosing items with the \"do you want a Close the Loop container?\" option when available. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_M4TnnC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why am I not receiving a Discount Code for my Close the Loop return?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>Close the Loop credits will now be given in Partner Perks Points.</p><p>Points can be redeemed for $1 per 100 points. Your returned Eco-Jug is now worth 800 points, which has a redemption value of $8.</p><p>You no longer will be required to save coupon codes or worry about stacking. Your combined points will be available in your account to redeem at checkout.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9jPaHy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I combine points from multiple Close the Loop shipments?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! This is the best part about using a Points Reward system. The points you earn are applied directly to your account and will be added to your previous points to earn even greater rewards.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JKETwi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I can see that you received my box(es). How come I don't see my points yet?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>We try to unpack and record returns on a weekly basis. If we have a particularly busy week, the warehouse team might not have a chance to get the information to the office right away. </p><p>Once the count has been recorded and processed, your points will be manually entered into your account. You will receive an email notification when your points are available.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CdLeFJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why didn't I receive points for all of my returns?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>Points are only rewarded for packaging generated by Rustic Strength. We clean, sterilize and refill our packaging to be re-used in our Close the Loop program. Because we are not able to re-fill other packaging for this use, we cannot offer rewards for them. </p><p>We will however, accept any packaging. Afterall, the goal is to keep as much plastic from entering the landfill as possible! We can use many of these in-house or we ensure that they are properly recycled.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4DJqzg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I schedule a pallet pickup for my empty barrels or totes?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>To schedule a pick-up:</p><p>Contact the carrier of your choice. We suggest freightquote.com, RXO or XPO, however you are in complete control of your pallet pick-ups.</p><p>Your empties must be securely fastened to the pallet in order for the driver to pick them up. </p><p>On the date scheduled, the driver will pickup during your business hours, typically in the afternoon.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PEFQwV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many returns do I need to pack on a pallet?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>In order to maximize your value for pallet returns, we recommend:</p><p>8 Barrels</p><p>or</p><p>80 Eco-Jugs</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_kiKkzJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I find the weights and measurements of my containers for return?",
            "icon": "recycle",
            "row_content": "<p>For Pallet Returns, you will need the weights and measurements of our containers. Here is a quick guide to help you:</p><p><em>Weights and measurements can vary due to differences in the amount of soap left, caps or lack of, differences in size / material of pallet or other factors. Always estimate higher or get exact details to avoid additional charges.</em></p><p>8- 30 gallon drums (full pallet): </p><ul><li>200 lb</li><li>48 x 40 x 63</li></ul><p>8- 55 gallon drums (full pallet):</p><ul><li>250 lb</li><li>48 x 40 x 75</li></ul><p>80- eco-jugs (full pallet):</p><ul><li>200 lb</li><li>48 x 40 x 78</li></ul><p></p><p>Single container details:</p><p>5 Gallon Eco-Jug Dimensions: </p><ul><li>2 lb</li><li>14.5 x 10.5 x 10 </li></ul><p>5 Gallon Bucket Dimensions: </p><ul><li>2 lb     </li><li>15 x 12 </li></ul><p>30 Gallon Drum Dimensions:   </p><ul><li>13lb</li><li>29 x 19 </li></ul><p>55 Gallon Drum Dimensions: </p><ul><li>24 lb</li><li>35 x 24</li></ul><p>275 Gallon Tote Dimensions:</p><ul><li>135 lb</li><li>48 x 40 x 46</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
